  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f9f053aa9b6903a",
      "translationZh": "我是 TensorSharp 的开发者。受 vLLM PR #57250 的启发，我为基于 DiffusionGemma GGUF 的 Jev 风格结构化决策添加并优化了原生的 /v1/systemone 端点。这使用了 DiffusionGemma 权重；“Jev 风格”指的是 API 和决策工作流。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ebd8a67a8a116745",
      "translationZh": "主要实现差异：TensorSharp 直接读取所请求标签的 logits，而不是要求模型以 JSON 格式生成概率。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f126098a450a0223",
      "translationZh": "我在一个小基准测试中将其与原始的 LocalJev 引擎进行了比较。在两个实现均返回有效响应的 27 个配对请求中，LocalJev 延迟与 TensorSharp 延迟的中位数比率为 3.345 倍。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be68ad674e96b138",
      "translationZh": "该测试涵盖了 12 个用例 × 3 次测量重复，每个请求包含三个决策：每个实现共 36 个请求和 108 个预期决策。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5edd86c922e64986",
      "translationZh": "下方的延迟统计仅包含成功的请求，因此汇总列涵盖的是不同的子集。上述 3.345 倍的数值是根据匹配的成功请求对计算得出的，而非通过除以汇总均值或中位数获得。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e53227026886306",
      "translationZh": "Metric TensorSharp 原生 /v1/systemone 原始 LocalJev 引擎",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d60837cb55eab8b",
      "translationZh": "像往常一样启动 TensorSharp.Server.Host，使用 DiffusionGemma GGUF 模型，然后发送 Jev-format 请求到：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3458b255496d4aaa",
      "translationZh": "Python — 最小的计费分类示例：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0e20d66a802ebfdd",
      "translationZh": "curl — 使用仓库根目录中的示例请求文件：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e6898e03f48d8e88",
      "translationZh": "C# / .NET — 直接调用模型服务：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7844c1a44bded9ea",
      "translationZh": "我发现有趣的部分是使用本地模型进行有界决策，而不先让它写出 JSON 答案。在此工作负载上，direct-logit 方法更快，并避免了在 generation-based baseline 中看到的输出模式失败。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f383a85acb14d7c",
      "translationZh": "您接下来想测试哪些工作负载——工单路由、内容审核、代理工具选择，还是其他？",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
